s template helps operators communicate what the next stage actually needs without guessing each colleague’s preferred format. It also makes exceptions easier to compare because the team receives a consistent record of facts rather than a collection of incompatible success messages."]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"id":"deep-dive","className":"article-prose deep-dive","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Send a decision package, not a trail of messages."}],[["$","$19","0",{"children":[["$","p","0",{"children":["An operator should receive the approved asset revision, target account, final text, intended window and any required feature choices together. Scattered messages create a familiar failure: the right video is published with an earlier caption, or the latest edit is sent to the wrong account. Put the source of truth in one record and make the approval refer to that record’s specific revision."]}]]}]],["$","figure",null,{"className":"editorial-diagram diagram-timeline","children":[["$","figcaption",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mono acid","children":"THE IDEA, UNPACKED"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"An unambiguous handoff"}]]}],["$","ol",null,{"className":"diagram-items","children":[["$","li","Approved input",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"diagram-index","children":"01"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Approved input"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"A single revision containing the final publishing choices."}],false]}]]}],["$","li","Exception path",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"diagram-index","children":"02"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Exception path"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"What requires a pause or a renewed decision."}],false]}]]}],["$","li","Confirmed output",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"diagram-index","children":"03"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Confirmed output"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Status, post URL and any deviation from the plan."}],false]}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"diagram-caption","children":"Editorial model: a way to reason about the process, not measured platform results."}]]}],[["$","$19","0",{"children":[["$","$19","0",{"children":["$L1a"]}]]}]]]}],false,"$L1b","$L1c",false,"$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20"]}],"$L21"]}]
